                    176.0,
                    990.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. If no such option exists within the functional unit, the employee may elect to displace the least senior undesignated person in the geographic area in a lower classification for which the employee is qualified, provided the employee can perform the requirements of the position within approximately two (2) weeks.",
